{{!-- /the-faith-received/continental-reformed/ — the Continental Reformed shelf, whole.

     One page per shelf. Until 2026-09-23 these five traditions had no
     room of their own: they were filtered views of The Latin Library
     (/latin-library/?tradition=Continental Reformed), which held all six traditions
     at once and was therefore named after a language rather than
     anything a reader was looking for. The data owner's word for that
     was that the Latin Library "has been departed, because everything
     else has been shifted to other shelfs". This is that shelf.

     faith-room.js reads the collection from tfr-room-collection and
     the shelf from tfr-room-shelf below. Where a shelf meta is present
     the room is the WHOLE shelf: its own collection plus every work
     under that tradition in the collections that carry more than one
     (English Editions), so the count here agrees with the count on the
     card the reader clicked.

     Generated as a set with the collection rooms: if one changes,
     change them all. --}}

<main class="faith-received faith-room">

  <section class="bhero bhero--tool">
    <div class="bhero-inner container">
      <p class="bhero-kicker"><a href="/the-faith-received/">The Faith Received</a> <span aria-hidden="true">&middot;</span> <a href="/the-faith-received/browse/">Library</a></p>
      <h1>Continental Reformed</h1>
      <p class="bhero-sub">Reformed divinity from the continent. Calvin, Turretin, Vermigli and the Dutch and Swiss theologians, in Latin with English alongside. Every work on the shelf, sorted by author. Jump by letter, or search for a name or a title.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bband faith-room-body">
    <div class="container" data-faith-room></div>
  </section>

